	)
	(text "Pinout = keyboard/hardware/design/nets.py SLOT_PINS (SPEC §4.2), seen from the coupon: odd pins one row,\neven pins the other; a GND opposite every lane. PRESENT_N (32) is strapped to GND.\nPin 39 is the slot KEY (owner's decision D2, 2026-11-27): no pin, no pad, no net; pull the header's\npin 39 before soldering: J1 is DNP for the assembler and fitted by hand (SPEC §11 #31). Mounted on the\nbottom, pins down into the motherboard's 8.5 mm socket (SPEC §9). Not hot-plugged."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 19.05 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(italic yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "29ca8cc7-461d-57cb-836a-bae9dd72e31b")
	)
